  "changes": [
    "Sibling build/python/util crates remain at the exact pinned git revision instead of sibling paths.",
    "ConfigError::cause borrows anyhow::Error::root_cause before loader path context; no native parser/loader or severity behavior is changed.",
    "One native cause-context control is added; all upstream source and tests remain present.",
    "Borrowed ConfigError::cause_chain yields the genuine root cause followed by native field/file contexts, preserving configure() diagnostics in the bounded streaming adapter."
